<title>HONG KONG: Wing Fai interim net loss HK$30.15 mln.</title>
<headline>Wing Fai interim net loss HK$30.15 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended January 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   6.3 loss   vs 4.9 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  22.45 loss vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    30.15 loss vs 18.84 profit</p>
<p>    Turnover		     177.49     vs 325.29</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wing Fai International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>Note - Wing Fai repairs and maintains civil engineering establishments and buildings in the public sector, including Hong Kong International Airport, and installs utilities including telephone facilities.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on provision for doubtful debts made in respect of the advances to subcontractors.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
